      "side": 1,
      "message": "Good catch.\n\nI took an approach where I check if the timer-wheel is free or not (`sfdp_timer_is_free_internal`) for each session entry we iterate on, to see if it is already marked for expired.\n\nThis allows us to handle consecutive batches without risks of duplicate stops on sessions.\n\nI\u0027ve also added a test that triggers this specific scenario with potential batch overlap, which stops the expiry node from running and sends multiple batches, and verify they stack properly.",
